// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - OneWeaknessSouvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P4100432777" "A Photo of Penny"
// tDetailString :
"P1778247944" "Mr. Wu Yin, the CEO of global mega-corporation Yin Corp, gave you this picture of his daughter, Penelope Yin. Whenever you look at her smiling face you can't help but smile and think that a doting daughter is any father's: <br><br><b><color gold>One Weakness</color></b><br><br>You remember the moment well, finding Mr. Wu Yin giving a victory speech to the surviving Syndicate over the Yin Corp tower's internal sound system. Tub Ci Tang informed Yin of your arrival, and then the two of them explained their plan to join the Resistance in order to rescue his daughter, Penelope, from Praetor Tilman's Seer program. It was here that you were faced with a choice: If you arrested Yin it would cause the Syndicate to break up once more, flooding the streets of Imperial City with violence. But if you let Mr. Yin carry out his plan to join forces with the Resistance, then you would validate all of the vicious atrocities that he and his organization have inflicted upon Praetoria City and the world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1589986878" "{HeroName}, good work taking down Octavian, his men are scattering like pigeons. What's the situation?"
// Answer Text :
"P238135955" "The PPD are moving in on Yin Corp."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4285191875" "We want Yin and Tang out of there safely. Can you ensure that happens and not blow your cover?"
// Answer Text :
"P1692150112" "So long as Yin doesn't betray it, yes."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3716396110" "If Yin betrays us then he dooms himself. He has everything to lose if he doesn't accept your help. Remind him of this fact if he seems intent on being difficult."
// Answer Text :
"P4262229902" "Understood."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Yin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3123388222" "{HeroName}, it's good to see you've made the right choice. Tilman has gone too far, kidnapping my daughter. She shouldn't have to go into the Seer program just because she is gifted. Who is he to decide what is right for <i>my</i> daughter? There is still such a thing as family, {HeroName}, and I intend to uphold that. I'm going to need your help to hold off the PPD while I try to get myself to the Resistance."
// Answer Text :
"P1278023777" "No worries. I called off the PPD. You need to get out of here."
// Answer Text :
"P4286893375" "Understood. I'll need to silence McKnight as well."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2501309559" "Excellent! I hope we will see each other soon, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P314508084" "Alright, then let us fight off whatever may come."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4223023327" "I've got a few men on standby, but this is our bust, {HeroName}, I'm not letting some flatfoot recruit get the credit for taking down Wu Yin.<br><br><color orange>Are you ready to arrest the head of the Syndicate?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3833007907" "Raid Yin Corp"
// SendOffString :
"P1757341731" "Alright, I'll head up the north end of the tower, you take the south. I've got a bunch of backup on standby, but they aren't exactly sure who we're after. Nobody is going to steal this moment of glory from me.<br><br>We've got to move fast before the Syndicate consolidates its scattered forces.<br><br><color orange>For players who want a tougher fight you can call off the PPD Reinforcements by accessing a computer inside.</color><br><br><color Paragon>Members of the Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should inform him of what is happening.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3387340253" "Raid Yin Corp (Single Player)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2401886917" "Remember, I'm going up the north side, you take the south.<br><br><color orange>For players who want a tougher fight you can call off the PPD Reinforcements by accessing a computer inside.</color>"
// TaskTitle :
"P321808647" "<color deepskyblue>One Weakness</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2538183532" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Penny For Your Thoughts</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2974824067" "You can hear the sound of someone speaking over the building's internal sound system..."

