// SaysList :
"P394615658" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGrey>Victory... victory is not a call to rest...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGrey>It is a call to keep stride, to keep moving with purpose...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGrey>Our purpose now is to consolidate, rebuild...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGrey>So that the joy of victory shall never leave us."

