// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P3897974495" "<em Atease>"
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P258683504" "<t=4 d=4>Master, {HeroName} has arrived, just as you anticipated."
// 5 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P2175821278" "<t=5 d=5 em yourewelcome>That {Hero.gender=male he|she} did. I'm sure {Hero.gender=male he|she} knows, however, about my missing daughter."
// 4 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P157599327" "<em disagree t=4 d=4>You should know, {HeroName}, that my wonderful daughter, Penelope, was kidnapped by 'Praetor' Tilman, because of her psychic abilities."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P2416823275" "<em thanks t=4 d=4>Now, Master Yin and I seek to ally the Syndicate with the Resistance, in order to save Penelope's life."
// 3 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P1258435326" "<t=3 d=3 em point>This, {HeroName}, is your chance to help."
// 4 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P3914606809" "<t=4 d=4>You've seen the chaos that Tilman's crime has caused. Arresting me will only destroy the stability we have just now reclaimed."
// 4 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P2484653052" "<t=4 d=4>But together we can do good. With the Resistance we can keep the Syndicate under control and save my daughter."
// LeftText :
"P669181352" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Aid Wu Yin</color></scale><br>Let Wu Yin retain control of the Syndicate</span><br><br><color Paragon>Aid the Resistance</color><br>Mr. Wu Yin seeks to form an alliance between the Syndicate and the Resistance so that he can rescue his daughter Penelope from Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. However, Chance McKnight knows Yin's identity as the head of the Syndicate, you will have to silence him.<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P2955913780" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Arrest the Syndicate Leaders</color></scale><br>Put an end to the Syndicate crime organization</span><br><br><color orange>Aid the Loyalists</color><br>Wu Yin and Tub Ci Tang are wanted for being the defacto leaders of the largest criminal organization on the planet. Arresting these men will shatter the Syndicate into a thousand pieces, making them easy pickings for the PPD. Though innocents will likely be harmed in the immediate aftermath, in the end the Syndicate will be gone forever.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"

